# 🛒 E-Commerce Website - UI/UX Design

This project presents the UI/UX design for a modern **E-Commerce Website**, created as part of the **CODSOFT UI/UX Internship**.

---

## 🎯 Objective

Design a clean, user-friendly, and conversion-focused e-commerce website that provides a smooth shopping experience for users. The key focus areas include:
- Homepage
- Product listing
- Product details
- Cart & Checkout
- User authentication (Login/Signup)

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Figma  
- Adobe XD *(optional)*  
- Google Fonts  
- Material Icons

